// A chain of 250 generic types, each with a method whose signature names the next at the same
// argument: instances made while the previous one's members are checked, 250 deep. A finite chain
// well inside the limit on nested instances (ErrorInstDepth) is compiled.

mod generic_nest_chain_250;

